{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/3186cd7ce84fe5e62f4bada92452a5e1.avif?t=1753187215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the wheel and ride on this nostalgic rally trip out to the desert. Pick your driving crew and manage your vehicle and resources, as you encounter challenges on the road. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No stress though, just keep your engine running and your eyes on the road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/b2dcb40c9cdbcbd95c6ffe4fb175a78d.poster.avif?t=1753187215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/b2dcb40c9cdbcbd95c6ffe4fb175a78d.webm?t=1753187215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/b2dcb40c9cdbcbd95c6ffe4fb175a78d.mp4?t=1753187215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage crew and resources</strong>: From selecting your team members to managing your vehicle's resources \u2013 every decision impacts your journey. Carefully allocate your food, fuel, and spare parts to sustain your team and maintain your vehicle.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sh*t happens on the road: </strong>Bad weather, wild animals, bandits. Event encounters can either propel you forward or set you back \u2013 choose your course of action wisely!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A classic feel:</strong> Drive into the beautifully crafted, retro-inspired world. It\u2019s a pixel-perfect combo of retro visuals and modern gameplay.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race and race again:</strong> With multiple strategies and pilot combos to explore, and the unpredictable nature of the event system \u2013 every run will be a unique adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See ya at the races!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777220?t=1753187215","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777220?t=1753187215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/252487d52f10256e1021262e2f96c54ca376cc6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753187215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/252487d52f10256e1021262e2f96c54ca376cc6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753187215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/3186cd7ce84fe5e62f4bada92452a5e1.avif?t=1753187215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the wheel and ride on this nostalgic rally trip out to the desert. Pick your driving crew and manage your vehicle and resources, as you encounter challenges on the road. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No stress though, just keep your engine running and your eyes on the road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/b2dcb40c9cdbcbd95c6ffe4fb175a78d.poster.avif?t=1753187215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/b2dcb40c9cdbcbd95c6ffe4fb175a78d.webm?t=1753187215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/extras/b2dcb40c9cdbcbd95c6ffe4fb175a78d.mp4?t=1753187215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage crew and resources</strong>: From selecting your team members to managing your vehicle's resources \u2013 every decision impacts your journey. Carefully allocate your food, fuel, and spare parts to sustain your team and maintain your vehicle.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sh*t happens on the road: </strong>Bad weather, wild animals, bandits. Event encounters can either propel you forward or set you back \u2013 choose your course of action wisely!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A classic feel:</strong> Drive into the beautifully crafted, retro-inspired world. It\u2019s a pixel-perfect combo of retro visuals and modern gameplay.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race and race again:</strong> With multiple strategies and pilot combos to explore, and the unpredictable nature of the event system \u2013 every run will be a unique adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See ya at the races!</p>","developers":["Firedrake Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"496170","name":"Desert Race Adventures"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777220/5d4b057ea60899fe862963747ba15d726d33994d/header.jpg?t=1753187215","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257166446,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166446/movie480.mp4?t=1753176582","max":"http://video.akamai.s